AutoFlow 1.2.0
• Undo/redo in the editor, run from any step or just one step
• Folders, multi-select and bulk actions in the library
• Switch a schedule or hotkey off without losing its setup
• Secrets manager for {{secret:name}}
• Import reference images for Find image in the app
• Run history shows each step's time and lets you run again
• A scheduled flow that fails now tells you with a notification
• Scheduled flows start more reliably while the phone is idle
